{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17217020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17217020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721702001:1":{"text":"グウィネス、今日はすまなかった。急ぎの公務が入ってしまってな……","source_cn":"格温妮丝，关于今天……我很抱歉。临时有紧急公务绊住了脚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAD9DE2DA3E80197","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721702002:1":{"text":"構いません、指揮官。軍人が任務を優先するのは当然です。いつも何かと理由をつけて、私を捜査から遠ざけていらっしゃるのと同じように、何かご事情があるのでしょう。","source_cn":"没关系，司令。身为军人，任务优先。我能理解您的苦衷，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B2D1F1A6A18880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721702003:1":{"text":"お前が怒っているのは分かる。その埋め合わせとして、古聖堂の調査に関すること以外なら、できる限り何でも聞こう。","source_cn":"我知道你在生气。作为补偿，除了让你涉险去调查圣古堂消失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8414EC49563B10B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721702004:1":{"text":"本当ですか？でしたら、今すぐ上層街の<style=\"highlight\">ベルベット・トラップ</style>を封鎖のうえ捜査し、経営者のファティマを逮捕してください。","source_cn":"真的吗？那好。既然您不让我调查，那就请您立刻下令——封...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC80F20D8E06CC6BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721702005:2":{"text":"ベルベット・トラップを封鎖だと？そこで何かあったのか？","source_cn":"什么，查封丝绒陷阱？今天发生什么事了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D96609CCEAEE617","variant_status":"","mal