title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1721702020:1":{"text":"それまでは駐屯地で大人しく待機していろ！勝手に持ち場を離れるな！","source_cn":"现在，你给我老老实实待在驻地里反省，哪里也不许去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB77E7DF9E6117E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1721702021:1":{"text":"どこへ行くのですか？容疑者がはっきりした今――","source_cn":"您要去哪？既然知道了嫌疑人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B3A214FA1FE5A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1721702022:1":{"text":"とにかくお前はここにいろ！これは命令だ！","source_cn":"待在守备军驻地！这是命令！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76BCC92E621C1AC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1721702023:1":{"text":"ヘンドリックはそれ以上何も言わず、慌ただしい様子で駐屯地を後にした。","source_cn":"亨德里克没有再多做解释，就那样神色匆匆地离开了驻地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9634058E19755122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1721702024:1":{"text":"足早に去っていく父の背中を見つめながら、グウィネスの疑念は晴れるどころか、ますます深まっていった。","source_cn":"格温妮丝看着那个迅速出行的背影，心中的疑云不仅没有消散...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A0E73C9627715ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_st